WEBVTT

00:00.700 --> 00:03.740
Welcome to STEP Library. Here's a one-minute tour.

00:04.900 --> 00:07.210
First, sign in with your Google account.

00:07.900 --> 00:10.570
Your email needs to be registered with the library.

00:11.000 --> 00:13.730
To find a book, search by title or author.

00:15.800 --> 00:18.590
Available shows how many copies are on the shelf.

00:19.000 --> 00:21.530
None left means every copy is out.

00:21.680 --> 00:24.110
To borrow, tap Scan QR.

00:24.260 --> 00:27.140
Then point your camera at the QR code on the book.

00:27.600 --> 00:29.520
That's it. The book is yours.

00:32.800 --> 00:36.680
The Reading tab lists every book you have out, and how long you've had it.

00:39.800 --> 00:42.840
To return, tap Scan QR on Reading.

00:42.990 --> 00:44.490
Scan the book you're returning.

00:45.600 --> 00:47.770
You can rate it if you like. It's optional.

00:51.400 --> 00:53.950
Past reads keeps every book you've returned.

00:54.300 --> 00:56.100
You can change a rating any time.

00:57.900 --> 00:59.970
You're ready. Happy reading!
